[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0395","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0395.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0721","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000/7.0 扩展存储过程权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 和 2000 安装程序为与辅助函数关联的扩展存储过程设置了过弱的访问权限，导致低权限用户甚至远程攻击者可通过调用 xp_execresultset、xp_printstatements、xp_displayparamstmt 等存储过程以管理员权限执行任意 SQL 命令。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，实现完全权限提升，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Microsoft 已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0721"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft SQL Server 2000 Service Pack 3 (SP3) 或更高版本，该更新已修复扩展存储过程的权限问题。如无法升级，手动执行以下操作：连接到 SQL Server 后运行 `REVOKE EXECUTE ON xp_execresultset TO PUBLIC; REVOKE EXECUTE ON xp_printstatements TO PUBLIC; REVOKE EXECUTE ON xp_displayparamstmt TO PUBLIC;` 撤销 PUBLIC 角色的执行权限。同时建议在防火墙层面限制对 SQL Server 端口 (1433/TCP) 的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2002-q3/0087.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102950473002959&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=102950792606475&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/399531","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/818939","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/939675","http://www.ngssoftware.com/advisories/mssql-esppu.txt","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-043","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21718","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0721.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0721","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0721.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0721.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2002/CVE-2002-0721.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0721.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0721.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0721.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0721.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-0721.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0395.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0275","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0275.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0855","title":"GNU Mailman 跨站点脚本漏洞","description":"GNU Mailman 2.0.12 之前版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 ml-name 功能的 adminpw 或 info 参数提交特制的订阅选项数据，在订阅者浏览器中执行恶意脚本，从而窃取会话凭证或实施钓鱼攻击。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，影响范围广泛。GNU 官方已在 Mailman 2.0.12 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0855"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:16Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Mailman 至 2.0.12 或更高版本，该版本修复了 adminpw 和 info 参数中的跨站脚本漏洞。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache mod_security）对 adminpw 和 info 参数进行 HTML 实体编码过滤，阻止恶意脚本注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0268.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000522","http://mail.python.org/pipermail/mailman-announce/2002-July/000043.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-147","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9985.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-176.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-177.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-178.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-181.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5298","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21641","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0855.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0855.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0855","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0855.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0855.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0855.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/106a1fdac91d72807fea971dfa93d601744b9ae9/2002/CVE-2002-0855.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0855.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0855.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0855.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0275.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0275.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0275.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0031","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0875","title":"SGI IRIX 6.5.x FAM 任意根目录文件列表信息泄露漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.5.x 系统中 FAM（File Alteration Monitor）服务存在文件信息泄露漏洞。FAM 用于监控文件系统变更，但其默认配置未对文件列表操作进行充分的权限检查，导致低权限用户能够列举本应仅允许 root 用户访问的目录中的文件名称。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需特殊认证即可利用该漏洞获取受限目录的文件名信息，为后续攻击（如定位敏感文件）提供情报。该漏洞影响 FAM 2.6.6、2.6.8 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0875"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:18Z","remediation":"升级 FAM 至 2.6.10 及以上版本。Debian 用户安装 DSA-154 对应安全更新包；Red Hat 用户应用 RHSA-2005-005 提供的补丁；FreeBSD 用户参照 FreeBSD-SN-02:05 更新 ports 中的 fam 包；SGI IRIX 用户安装 advisory 20000301-03-I 提供的补丁。如无需文件变更通知功能，可停止 famd 服务并禁用自启动作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-154","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9880.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2005-005.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5487","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21720","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0875.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0875","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0875.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0875.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/eaba6ba6891dae2972376e68ae56a38b641030d7/2002/CVE-2002-0875.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0875.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0875.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0875.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0875.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0875.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0030","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0871","title":"xinetd 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"xinetd 2.3.4 版本在启动子服务时错误地泄露了信号管道的文件描述符给子进程，导致由 xinetd 启动的服务可通过操作该泄露的管道文件描述符造成拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 xinetd 2.3.4 版本，攻击条件为本地攻击者能够控制或启动由 xinetd 管理的服务进程，攻击者可通过向泄露的信号管道写入数据导致 xinetd 主进程异常终止或服务中断，造成拒绝服务影响，CVSS 评分 2.1，属于本地低权限拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0871"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-09-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:18Z","remediation":"建议升级 xinetd 至 2.3.5 或更高版本（如 xinetd-2.3.5-1 或更新版本），该版本已修复信号管道文件描述符泄漏漏洞。若暂无法升级，可通过在 xinetd.conf 中为相关服务设置 `instances = 1` 限制并发实例数，或在防火墙层面限制对 xinetd 管理服务的访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102935383506155&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9844.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-053.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-196.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-228.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5458","https://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-151","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0871.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0871","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0871.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0871.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0e284be0197bae1df3d577d9f9f2155925bb6629/2002/CVE-2002-0871.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0871.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0871.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0871.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0871.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0871.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0009","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0654","title":"Apache HTTP Server 2.0 路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache 2.0至2.0.39版本在Windows、OS2及Netware平台上存在路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送对.var文件的请求，服务器返回的错误消息中会泄露服务器完整路径名；或通过触发脚本（子进程）无法执行时的错误消息获取路径信息。该漏洞导致敏感信息泄露，攻击者无需认证即可利用，影响范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0654"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-09-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:52Z","remediation":"升级至 Apache HTTP Server 2.0.40 或更高版本（官方于 2002-08-09 发布此修复版本）。如无法立即升级，可在 httpd.conf 中禁用 multiviews 选项（Options -MultiViews），并移除 .var 类型映射文件或将其访问权限限制为仅本地可读；同时确保 cgi 脚本目录无多余可执行脚本，以降低路径泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102951160411052&w=2","http://www.apache.org/dist/httpd/CHANGES_2.0","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9875.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9876.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5485","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5486","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/54a42d4b01968df1117cea77fc53d6beb931c0e05936ad02af93e9ac%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5df9bfb86a3b054bb985a45ff9250b0332c9ecc181eec232489e7f79%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r0276683d8e1e07153fc8642618830ac0ade85b9ae