-1444.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1444.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1444.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1444.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1444","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1444.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1444.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1444.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1444.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb5f9e7ddda132923d86346e273be6f1c71ee410/2002/CVE-2002-1444.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0589.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0589.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0594","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0594.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1453","title":"MyWebServer 1.0.2 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"MyWebServer 1.0.2 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，由于服务器在处理超长 HTTP 请求时未对用户输入进行充分过滤，远程攻击者可通过发送特制的长 HTTP 请求并在其后附加恶意脚本，利用该漏洞将脚本和 HTML 代码注入到服务器返回的错误消息页面中。当用户访问包含恶意内容的错误页面时，嵌入的脚本将在用户浏览器中执行。该漏洞影响 MyWebServer 1.0.2 版本，攻击者可通过构造包含 JavaScript 代码的超长请求，诱导用户点击恶意链接，从而窃取会话令牌、Cookie 或执行其他恶意操作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1453"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:21Z","remediation":"如 MyWebServer 有后续版本，请升级到厂商发布的最新版本以修复此问题。若官方已停止维护且无补丁可用，建议迁移至仍在持续更新的 Web 服务器软件（如 Apache、Nginx 或 IIS），并在迁移前通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截超长 HTTP 请求中包含的脚本与 HTML 标签，同时对服务器返回的错误页面实施严格的输出编码，防止恶意内容回显给用户。临时缓解措施包括在边界防火墙或反向代理层过滤包含 `<script>`、`javascript:` 等关键词的请求，降低跨站脚本攻击的成功率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0077.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102935720109934&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9861.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5470","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21710","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1453.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1453.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1453","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1453.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1453.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/092113bf9ab92144574ec15fc26608ac15913e5a/2002/CVE-2002-1453.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1453.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ccbb22644b8f8cd8300036a10ac1ec6d68c2d1a3/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1453.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1453.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1453.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0594.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0594.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0594.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0593","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0593.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1452","title":"MyWebServer 1.0.2 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2002-1452是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1452"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:21Z","remediation":"升级到 MyWebServer 3.0+ 版本，该版本修复了 searchTarget 参数的长度验证漏洞，或应用官方安全补丁；在防火墙中添加规则，限制 searchTarget 参数长度不超过 256 字节；启用日志记录并监控可疑的长参数搜索请求，以检测潜在的缓冲区溢出攻击尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0077.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102935720109934&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9859.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5469","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21709","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1452.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1452.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1452","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1452.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1452.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2002/CVE-2002-1452.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1452.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6450d916b228b26926c778e450e50985a2beb640/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1452.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1452.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1452.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0593.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0593.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0593.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0590","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0590.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1445","title":"W3C CERN HTTPd 3.0 Proxy 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"CERN Proxy Server（W3C CERN httpd 3.0）存在跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意脚本的链接指向不存在的页面，当用户访问该链接时，代理服务器在返回的错误页面中会原样插入该链接名称，导致恶意脚本在用户浏览器中执行。攻击者利用该漏洞可窃取用户会话 Cookie、重定向用户至恶意网站或篡改页面内容。该漏洞影响所有使用 W3C CERN HTTPd 3.0 代理服务的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击，只需诱使目标用户点击恶意构造的链接即可完成利用。建议升级至安全版本或打补丁修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1445"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:20Z","remediation":"建议将 CERN HTTPd 3.0 Proxy 替换为 Apache、Nginx 等仍在维护的现代 Web 服务器或代理软件，因为 CERN HTTPd 已停止开发且未发布针对此漏洞的补丁。如短期内无法替换，应在代理前端部署 Web 应用防火墙（WAF），过滤错误页面中回显的 URL 参数，阻止 HTML 及 SCRIPT 标签注入，同时修改 Proxy 错误页面模板，对用户提供的 URL 进行 HTML 实体编码后再输出，防止跨站脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-08/0097.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9834.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5447","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21704","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1445.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1445.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1445","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1445.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1445.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1445.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2002/CVE-2002-1445.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/dac938c9caec155f79e9c8bb28e43accc9c69f2f/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1445.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1445.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1445.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0590.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0590.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0590.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0452","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0452.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0833","title":"Qualcomm Eudora 5 MIME MultiPart Boundary 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"高通 Eudora 5 邮件客户端的 MIME 多部分边界解析模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可构造包含超长边界字符串的多部分 MIME 邮件，诱导受害者接收并解析该邮件，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而在用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Eudora 5.1.1 及 5.0-J 版本（Windows 平台），CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、低复杂度、无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性均受损。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0833"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:13Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Eudora 6.0 或更高版本（已修复该边界字符串缓冲区溢出），或迁移至现代邮件客户端如 Thunderbird/Outlook。若必须继续使用旧版本，可在邮件网关层面配置 MIME 边界长度限制（如限制 boundary 参数不超过 256 字符），并禁用自动预览/自动解析多部分 MIME 消息功能以阻断攻击向量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102858453720304&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102883538924494&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9765.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5397","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21680","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0833.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0833.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0833","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0833.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0833.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1a96290b5e035ce53ab9adc58193928385ac790b/2002/CVE-2002-0833.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0833.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/918ac66f0b50ab0d2a013bdf692688d3c0abefbc/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0833.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0833.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0833.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0452.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0451","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0451.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0824","title":"FreeBSD/NetBSD/OpenBSD pppd 任意文件权限修改竞争条件漏洞","description":"tags.<value>BSD系统的pppd程序存在符号链接竞争条件漏洞，本地用户可通过将tty设备文件替换为指向目标文件的符号链接，利用pppd在打开tty设备时的竞态窗口，修改任意文件的权限。该漏洞影响FreeBSD 4.x、NetBSD 1.4.x/1.5.x/1.6及OpenBSD 3.x等版本，攻击条件为攻击者需具备本地用户权限并能访问pppd进程。CVSS评分为6.9，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0824"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:12Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 系统中的 pppd 至 4.4.2-RELEASE 或更高版本，或通过 ports 树执行 `cd /usr/ports/net/ppp && make install clean` 重新编译安装。NetBSD 用户应升级至 NetBSD-SA2002-010 公告中修复后的 pppd 版本。OpenBSD 用户需升级至 OpenBSD 3.1 或更新版本以消除该竞争条件漏洞。修复完成后，通过 `pppd --version` 确认版本已更新，并检查 `/etc/ppp/options` 中是否包含 `noauth` 或 `require-pap` 等安全配置项。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102812546815606&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9738.php","http://www.openbsd.org/errata31.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5355","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21669","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0824.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0824.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0824.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0824","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0824.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0824.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0824.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0824.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/4f65f772070b3f93cf10dae516c0292b5e70e1bb/2002/CVE-2002-0824.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/918ac66f0b50ab0d2a013bdf692688d3c0abefbc/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0824.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0451.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0451.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0451.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0450","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0450.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0823","title":"Microsoft Windows Winhlp32.exe 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/2000/NT 4.0 的 Winhlp32.exe 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 HTML 文档，调用 HTML Help ActiveX 控件 (HHCtrl.ocx) 并在 Item 参数中传入超长路径名触发溢出，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 95/98/2000/NT 4.0 等经典版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于高危漏洞。攻击条件为：受害者需打开或预览包含恶意 ActiveX 调用的 HTML 页面（如网页、HTML 邮件或 .chm 文件），无需身份认证即可远程利用。成功利用可导致任意代码执行，攻击者可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0823"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:12Z","remediation":"The user is asking me to fix the [remediation] field for CVE-2002-0823 based on the detailed information provided. Looking at the presearch data:\n\n1. NVD description: \"Buffer overflow in Winhlp32.exe allows remote attackers to execute arbitrary code via an HTML document that calls the HTML Help ActiveX control (HHCtrl.ocx) with a long pathname in the Item parameter.\"\n\n2. The vulnerability is in WinHlp32.exe in Windows 95/98/2000/NT 4.0\n3. CVSS: 7.5 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P)\n4. Published: 2002-08-12\n\n5. There are various references including Microsoft security bulletins and exploit info\n\nI need to write a remediation field that:\n- Is ≥20 characters\n- In Chinese\n- Provides specific, actionable steps\n- Doesn't say \"please refer to official announcement\"\n- References actual patch information if available\n\nLooking at the references, I see:\n- http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3Ben-us%3Bq293338 (this looks like a Microsoft KB article)\n- Various other security advisory links\n\nFor a vulnerability from 2002, the remediation would typically involve:\n1. Installing the appropriate Microsoft security patches\n2. Or disabling the vulnerable functionality\n3. Upgrading to newer versions\n\nThe Microsoft KB link q293338 suggests there's a specific patch. I should reference this.\n\nLet me craft a proper remediation in Chinese that's ≥20 characters, specific, and actionable:\n\n\"建议安装适用于 Windows 95/98/2000/NT 4.0 的 Microsoft 安全补丁包 Q293338，或升级到 Windows NT 4.0 SP6 及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在注册表中禁用 HTML Help ActiveX 控件 (HHCtrl.ocx) 以缓解风险。\"\n\nThis is:\n- ≥20 characters\n- In Chinese\n- Specific (Q293338 patch, SP6 upgrade)\n- Actionable (install patch, upgrade, disable ActiveX control)\n\n\n- Provides clear mitigation strategies for systems unable to implement immediate fixes\n\nI recognize the critical nature of this vulnerability, which allows remote code execution through a simple HTML document interaction. The patch and system upgrade strategies offer direct protection against potential exploitation, while registry modification serves as an emergency workaround for legacy systems.建议安装适用于 Windows 95/98/2000/NT 4.0 的 Microsoft 安全补丁包 Q293338，或升级到 Windows NT 4.0 SP6 及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在注册表中禁用 HTML Help ActiveX 控件 (HHCtrl.ocx) 以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102822806329440&w=2","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3Ben-us%3Bq293338","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9746.php","http://www.osvdb.org/2991","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4857","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21485","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0823.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2002/CVE-2002-0823.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0823.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0823.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0823.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0823","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0823.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0823.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0823.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0823.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0450.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0450.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0449","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0449.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0814","title":"VMware GSX Server 2.0 认证服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"VMware GSX Server 2.0.0 build-2050 的授权服务（Authorization Service）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经充分身份验证的远程攻击者可向目标系统的认证服务发送包含超长 GLOBAL 参数的特制请求，触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而执行任意系统指令。该漏洞影响运行 VMware GSX Server 2.0 的 Windows 服务器平台，攻击者成功利用后可完全控制宿主机操作系统及其中运行的全部虚拟机实例。由于 VMware 安装时可能创建默认账户，攻击者只需获取默认账户凭据即可完成利用，ExploitDB 已公开相关利用代码。VMware 已在官方安全公告中发布补丁修复该问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0814"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:11Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 VMware GSX Server 至 2.0.1 或更高版本，或从 VMware 官方安全页面 http://www.vmware.com/download/gsx_security.html 下载并安装对应补丁。若无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制对认证服务端口的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接，并禁用默认/弱口令账户以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2002-q3/0057.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102752511030425&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102765223418716&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9663.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5294","http://www.vmware.com/download/gsx_security.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21639","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0814.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0814.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0814","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0814.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0814.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7753953b586683c230526e07a6b8b2948b832025/2002/CVE-2002-0814.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0814.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/918ac66f0b50ab0d2a013bdf692688d3c0abefbc/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0814.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0814.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-0814.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0449.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0448","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0448.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0813","title":"Cisco IOS TFTP服务器长文件名缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 11.1、11.2、11.3 版本的 TFTP 服务器功能存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119）。该漏洞源于 TFTP 服务器在处理超长文件名字符串时，未对输入长度进行充分校验，导致数据写入堆缓冲区时发生越界。远程攻击者无需认证即可触发该漏洞，通过向目标设备发送包含极长文件名的特制 TFTP 请求，可导致 TFTP 服务崩溃致使设备重置，引发拒绝服务；甚至可能修改设备配置，进而影响网络的正常运行。该漏洞危害等级较高，CVSS 评分 7.1，利用时需具备一定的攻击条件，建议受影响版本及时升级修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0813"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:11Z","remediation":"建议尽快将存在漏洞的 Cisco IOS 设备升级到 12.x 或更高修复版本（Cisco 官方于 2002 年发布安全公告，TFTP 服务器长文件名堆溢出漏洞仅在 IOS 11.1、11.2、11.3 中存在，后续版本已修复）。若无法立即升级，应在网络边界防火墙或接入访问控制列表（ACL）中限制对 TFTP 服务（UDP 69 端口）的访问，仅允许受信任的管理主机连接；同时关闭不必要的 TFTP 服务（使用 no tftp-server 命令），或改用带访问控制的 TFTP over SSH 等安全传输方式，以阻止远程攻击者发送超长文件名请求造成系统重置或配置被篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103002169829669&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/284634","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/ios-tftp-long-filename-pub.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9700.php","http://www.osvdb.org/854","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5328","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21655","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0813.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0813.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0813.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0813.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0813.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0813","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0813.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0813.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0813.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0813.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0448.toml"}]